  --type: any # Render mode: 'screenshot' (renders the page headlessly, default), 'iframe', or 'recording'. Only 'screenshot' generates image bytes.  * `screenshot` - Screenshot * `iframe` - Iframe * `recording` - Recording (default: screenshot)
